      "",
      "## Step 4 — The model key",
      "",
      "**Human step, briefly.** Open Everywhere runs its model stack through the Vercel AI Gateway. The",
      "operator gets a key at Vercel → AI Gateway → API Keys, or runs `eve link` themselves. On a project",
