      "",
      "## Step 5 — A local smoke check (optional, and never the finish line)",
      "",
      "```bash",
      "npm run dev",
      "```",
      "",
      "That is `eve dev` — a terminal UI on `http://127.0.0.1:3000`. It proves inference works with no",
